WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.420
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.690 --> 01:38.970
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.330 --> 01:41.890
[Episode 17]

4
01:44.259 --> 01:45.539
I really appreciate the spirit of mutual support

5
01:45.539 --> 01:46.640
you showed today.

6
01:47.009 --> 01:47.690
That's exactly how

7
01:47.690 --> 01:48.840
soldiers of the Yu Army

8
01:48.840 --> 01:49.759
should behave.

9
01:50.430 --> 01:51.490
These new uniforms

10
01:51.700 --> 01:52.650
are your reward.

11
01:53.700 --> 01:55.360
Go ahead and change into them.

12
02:11.120 --> 02:11.560
Here.

13
02:11.590 --> 02:12.340
Up.

14
02:18.650 --> 02:19.630
Keep at it.

15
02:19.790 --> 02:20.740
The front lines are waiting

16
02:20.740 --> 02:21.740
for this batch of gear.

17
02:21.740 --> 02:22.340
Yes, sir!

18
02:35.980 --> 02:36.700
Kill!

19
02:38.870 --> 02:39.560
Kill!

20
02:39.960 --> 02:40.750
Kill!

21
02:42.579 --> 02:43.130
Two!

22
02:44.680 --> 02:45.310
Three!

23
02:45.690 --> 02:46.620
Come on! Faster!

24
02:46.900 --> 02:47.430
Four!

25
02:49.079 --> 02:49.750
Five!

26
02:50.150 --> 02:50.960
Kill!

27
02:50.980 --> 02:51.790
Six!

28
02:52.440 --> 02:53.190
Salute!

29
02:55.560 --> 02:56.350
At ease!

30
02:56.590 --> 02:57.530
Continue training.

31
02:57.530 --> 02:58.150
Yes, sir!

32
02:58.460 --> 02:59.250
Mr. Yu.

33
02:59.590 --> 03:00.930
You executed Zhao Chenghai

34
03:00.930 --> 03:02.030
and rewarded those 4 soldiers.

35
03:02.030 --> 03:02.400
One!

36
03:02.430 --> 03:03.650
The morale in the army

37
03:04.300 --> 03:05.530
has changed overnight.

38
03:05.530 --> 03:06.330
Just look at them.

39
03:06.330 --> 03:07.440
There's a spark

40
03:07.470 --> 03:08.470
in their eyes now.

41
03:09.460 --> 03:11.000
I arrived here as Army Commander,

42
03:11.000 --> 03:12.300
and morale was shaky to begin with.

43
03:12.300 --> 03:13.350
To get thousands of men

44
03:13.350 --> 03:15.550
to follow my orders in such a short time,

45
03:15.740 --> 03:18.340
killing a few to make an example wasn't enough.

46
03:18.630 --> 03:20.170
I needed to give them hope.

47
03:21.800 --> 03:23.100
What I want is an army

48
03:23.130 --> 03:25.329
that follows orders without question.

49
03:25.560 --> 03:27.360
Setting those 4 up as role models

50
03:27.850 --> 03:30.130
will boost morale across the entire army.

51
03:30.130 --> 03:31.630
It'll also show our men

52
03:31.820 --> 03:34.380
that as long as they have the skills and the guts to fight,

53
03:34.380 --> 03:37.300
they can make something of themselves under my command.

54
03:37.300 --> 03:38.020
Kill!

55
03:38.740 --> 03:39.510
Five!

56
03:39.680 --> 03:40.350
Kill!

57
03:41.910 --> 03:42.390
Six!

58
03:42.390 --> 03:42.910
Kill!

59
03:44.570 --> 03:45.130
Kill!

60
03:45.680 --> 03:46.240
Seven!

61
03:46.800 --> 03:47.350
Kill!

62
04:19.579 --> 04:20.570
Xueting,

63
04:20.850 --> 04:22.050
you're finally back.

64
04:23.830 --> 04:25.390
How did you end up like this?

65
04:26.450 --> 04:27.530
Oh my god.

66
04:39.240 --> 04:40.050
Auntie.

67
04:41.790 --> 04:42.680
I'm sorry.

68
04:44.420 --> 04:45.740
I've made you worry.

69
04:48.820 --> 04:49.380
Mom.

70
04:49.909 --> 04:50.710
Come on.

71
04:51.180 --> 04:52.090
Get up.

72
04:52.880 --> 04:53.909
Come and sit.

73
05:10.090 --> 05:11.740
Thank goodness, thank goodness.

74
05:11.740 --> 05:12.670
Thank goodness.

75
05:15.990 --> 05:16.930
Xueting.

76
05:17.680 --> 05:19.480
If your mother were still alive,

77
05:20.040 --> 05:21.500
she never would've let you

78
05:21.520 --> 05:23.180
do something so dangerous.

79
05:26.590 --> 05:27.380
Kid.

80
05:28.380 --> 05:29.680
Promise me

81
05:30.880 --> 05:33.010
that from now on, no matter what you do,

82
05:33.670 --> 05:35.480
you'll think it through carefully first,

83
05:35.480 --> 05:36.300
okay?

84
05:40.770 --> 05:41.750
Okay.

85
05:44.150 --> 05:45.250
You're home now.

86
05:45.850 --> 05:47.100
That's all that matters.

87
05:47.100 --> 05:48.430
I'm so glad you're back.

88
05:57.790 --> 05:58.590
Xueting.

89
05:58.940 --> 06:00.890
You're dressed too lightly.

90
06:01.470 --> 06:02.970
The weather was nice a few days ago,

91
06:02.970 --> 06:03.940
so I took out all your winter clothes

92
06:03.940 --> 06:05.180
to air them out.

93
06:05.410 --> 06:05.880
Here,

94
06:06.030 --> 06:07.180
I'll grab a few for you

95
06:07.180 --> 06:08.170
to change into.

96
06:12.850 --> 06:13.840
Don't you have anything

97
06:13.840 --> 06:14.980
to say to me?

98
06:36.480 --> 06:37.480
What do you mean?

99
06:38.880 --> 06:40.030
Why was my sentence

100
06:41.050 --> 06:42.540
reduced by a month?

101
06:47.650 --> 06:49.980
It was because of Yu Changxuan, wasn't it?

102
06:56.650 --> 06:58.900
Yu Changxuan used my life

103
06:59.909 --> 07:01.590
to force you to be with him,

104
07:02.610 --> 07:03.410
didn't he?

105
07:22.260 --> 07:22.970
Yes.

106
07:23.350 --> 07:24.080
Why?

107
07:25.050 --> 07:25.530
Ye Pingjun,

108
07:25.530 --> 07:26.850
why did you agree to it?

109
07:27.300 --> 07:28.350
You knew full well

110
07:28.480 --> 07:29.500
that I'd rather die

111
07:29.500 --> 07:31.050
than have you sacrifice yourself for me!

112
07:31.050 --> 07:31.910
Why?

113
07:31.980 --> 07:33.210
What else could I do?

114
07:33.980 --> 07:35.180
Was I supposed to just stand by

115
07:35.180 --> 07:36.710
and watch you get executed?

116
07:37.090 --> 07:38.150
Did I have

117
07:38.150 --> 07:39.210
any other choice?

118
07:52.520 --> 07:54.580
I spend every day with a pen in my hand,

119
07:54.880 --> 07:57.409
thinking I could save people from suffering.

120
07:58.840 --> 07:59.780
But in the end,

121
08:00.240 --> 08:01.290
I couldn't even save

122
08:01.290 --> 08:02.240
the woman I love.

123
08:03.820 --> 08:04.740
I really am

124
08:05.240 --> 08:07.070
a complete and utter

125
08:09.200 --> 08:10.830
failure.

126
08:11.790 --> 08:12.480
Xueting!

127
08:12.480 --> 08:13.090
Xueting!

128
08:13.110 --> 08:13.610
Xueting.

129
08:13.610 --> 08:15.160
Don't be like this, Xueting.

130
08:15.160 --> 08:16.220
Xueting!

131
08:16.480 --> 08:17.210
Nothing happened between

132
08:17.210 --> 08:18.880
Yu Changxuan and me!

133
08:20.180 --> 08:21.180
See for yourself!

134
08:43.289 --> 08:44.610
What happened?

135
08:46.680 --> 08:48.150
I fought for my life,

136
08:50.500 --> 08:51.960
and that's why he let me go.

137
09:03.550 --> 09:04.500
I'm sorry.

138
09:05.610 --> 09:06.750
I'm so sorry.

139
09:09.180 --> 09:11.440
It's all my fault. I wasn't strong enough

140
09:12.130 --> 09:13.270
to protect you,

141
09:15.030 --> 09:16.490
and I put you through this.

142
09:24.460 --> 09:25.470
Xueting.

143
09:27.630 --> 09:30.130
It's all in the past now.

144
09:31.910 --> 09:33.680
Let's just leave it there,

145
09:35.540 --> 09:36.490
okay?

146
09:39.440 --> 09:40.480
Okay.

147
10:50.490 --> 10:52.440
Ammo! Where's the ammo?

148
10:54.050 --> 10:54.970
Come on!

149
11:08.850 --> 11:09.780
Charge with me!

150
11:10.380 --> 11:12.240
-Charge! -Let's go!

151
11:12.400 --> 11:15.150
-Let's go! -Let's go!

152
11:15.370 --> 11:18.610
-Let's go! -Let's go!

153
11:30.850 --> 11:33.840
[Yu Mansion]

154
11:34.100 --> 11:35.340
Reporting, Commander.

155
11:35.340 --> 11:36.580
Fifth Young Master Yu has successfully

156
11:36.580 --> 11:38.100
led his troops across a tributary of the Luan River,

157
11:38.100 --> 11:39.100
breaking through the Qi Army's

158
11:39.100 --> 11:40.100
first line of defense.

159
11:40.100 --> 11:41.120
We've won a great victory.

160
11:41.120 --> 11:41.740
Good.

161
11:42.670 --> 11:43.100
Also,

162
11:43.750 --> 11:44.790
Fifth Young Master Yu has ordered Brigade Commander Kuang

163
11:44.790 --> 11:45.720
and Director Gu

164
11:46.460 --> 11:47.700
to engage the Qi Army

165
11:47.720 --> 11:49.050
from the north and east.

166
11:49.170 --> 11:50.300
By the end of the day,

167
11:50.410 --> 11:51.770
he'll surely break through

168
11:51.770 --> 11:53.510
the second line of defense at Qingluan Mountain.

169
11:53.510 --> 11:55.560
With all three forces attacking from different directions,

170
11:55.560 --> 11:56.720
we'll definitely catch the Qi Army

171
11:56.720 --> 11:57.980
completely off guard.

172
11:58.270 --> 11:59.060
Good.

173
11:59.100 --> 11:59.820
Got it.

174
12:01.300 --> 12:02.730
We're saved.

175
12:04.550 --> 12:05.440
That's great! Wonderful.

176
12:05.440 --> 12:06.270
That's great.

177
12:08.050 --> 12:09.460
We're hiring proofreaders,

178
12:09.460 --> 12:10.580
but with your talent,

179
12:10.580 --> 12:11.970
you're capable of much more.

180
12:11.970 --> 12:13.590
Why not apply as a writer?

181
12:17.460 --> 12:18.250
Because

182
12:18.770 --> 12:19.320
I need a job

183
12:19.320 --> 12:20.670
that pays daily.

184
12:23.580 --> 12:24.950
He's Jiang Xueting—

185
12:25.170 --> 12:26.200
that Jun Guan.

186
12:32.490 --> 12:33.060
[Nanhuai Times]

187
12:33.060 --> 12:34.200
Come on, leave. Just leave.

188
12:34.200 --> 12:35.100
We don't need you here.

189
12:35.100 --> 12:35.720
Wait, but...

190
12:35.720 --> 12:36.470
Say no more.

191
12:36.530 --> 12:37.190
Just leave.

192
12:37.990 --> 12:38.940
[Nanhuai Times]

193
12:39.270 --> 12:39.870
Get out,

194
12:40.110 --> 12:41.830
before you bring trouble to anyone else.

195
12:41.830 --> 12:45.790
[Great Southern Printing Bureau]

196
12:45.820 --> 12:47.080
Leave. Just leave. [Nanhuai Popular Daily]

197
12:47.080 --> 12:47.590
We really can't

198
12:47.590 --> 12:48.770
afford to hire someone like you.

199
12:48.770 --> 12:49.630
Go on and leave.

200
12:49.820 --> 12:49.970
Wait, sir...

201
12:49.970 --> 12:50.820
[Nanhuai Popular Daily]

202
12:50.820 --> 12:51.620
Leave.

203
12:55.410 --> 12:57.380
[Nanhuai Popular Daily]

204
13:09.240 --> 13:10.040
Xueting.

205
13:12.220 --> 13:12.890
Xueting?

206
13:27.910 --> 13:28.580
Xueting!

207
13:28.840 --> 13:30.040
What happened to you?

208
13:30.990 --> 13:32.100
Pingjun.

209
13:32.670 --> 13:33.410
Don't sit on the ground.

210
13:33.410 --> 13:33.840
Come on, get up.

211
13:33.840 --> 13:34.560
Pingjun.

212
13:34.670 --> 13:35.460
It's cold on the ground.

213
13:35.460 --> 13:36.370
You're here.

214
13:39.640 --> 13:40.980
Careful, careful.

215
13:45.550 --> 13:46.480
Pingjun.

216
13:48.050 --> 13:49.670
Do you have any idea

217
13:49.670 --> 13:51.800
how many times I got turned away today?

218
13:52.930 --> 13:54.910
Everywhere I went,

219
13:54.940 --> 13:56.650
they refused to hire me.

220
13:57.600 --> 13:59.060
They all looked down on me.

221
13:59.270 --> 14:01.200
I'm a total loser.

222
14:07.990 --> 14:08.800
Xueting.

223
14:09.890 --> 14:11.670
Times are tough right now.

224
14:12.100 --> 14:14.100
You can take your time finding a job.

225
14:15.740 --> 14:17.620
Take my time?

226
14:18.410 --> 14:20.010
How am I supposed to find one?

227
14:20.440 --> 14:21.250
Right,

228
14:22.270 --> 14:23.960
just like last time—

229
14:24.950 --> 14:26.880
let you sacrifice yourself for me?

230
14:30.140 --> 14:31.060
Is that it?

231
14:36.770 --> 14:39.050
I, Jiang Xueting,

232
14:40.320 --> 14:44.010
am just a loser who has to rely on

233
14:45.150 --> 14:46.420
a woman sacrificing herself

234
14:46.420 --> 14:48.920
just to survive.

235
14:50.030 --> 14:51.420
A loser!

236
15:07.010 --> 15:07.720
Pingjun.

237
15:08.060 --> 15:08.790
Bring me

238
15:08.790 --> 15:10.180
that ball of red thread.

239
15:12.100 --> 15:12.870
Pingjun?

240
15:14.270 --> 15:14.920
Bring me

241
15:14.920 --> 15:16.410
that ball of red thread.

242
15:17.870 --> 15:18.510
Okay.

243
15:28.100 --> 15:28.870
Pingjun.

244
15:30.720 --> 15:32.840
Xueting hasn't been coming around much lately.

245
15:32.840 --> 15:34.170
Tell me the truth.

246
15:34.700 --> 15:37.300
What exactly has been going on between you two?

247
15:43.530 --> 15:45.370
Nothing happened between us.

248
15:45.390 --> 15:47.320
He's been looking for a job lately,

249
15:47.410 --> 15:49.140
so he's just been a little busy.

250
15:51.200 --> 15:52.320
Then tell me,

251
15:52.870 --> 15:54.870
how did things suddenly turn around

252
15:54.870 --> 15:56.700
for Xueting back then?

253
16:00.200 --> 16:01.920
Was it because of Mr. Yu?

254
16:05.990 --> 16:07.510
And he was the one

255
16:08.580 --> 16:11.010
who pulled strings to get me the surgery, too,

256
16:11.010 --> 16:11.770
wasn't he?

257
16:12.270 --> 16:12.610
[Ward 13]

258
16:12.610 --> 16:13.140
Doctor,

259
16:13.160 --> 16:14.010
please rest assured.

260
16:14.010 --> 16:15.670
We'll pay special attention.

261
16:15.700 --> 16:16.770
Mr. Yu specifically instructed us

262
16:16.770 --> 16:17.510
to use the best medicine

263
16:17.510 --> 16:19.030
and hire the best caregivers.

264
16:19.030 --> 16:20.580
Mr. Yu personally gave the order,

265
16:20.580 --> 16:21.940
so let's all be extra attentive.

266
16:21.940 --> 16:23.320
Report to me immediately

267
16:23.320 --> 16:24.490
if there's any change in the patient's condition.

268
16:24.490 --> 16:25.220
Understood.

269
16:25.770 --> 16:27.410
I just want to know

270
16:27.960 --> 16:31.050
what exactly is going on between you and him.

271
16:31.410 --> 16:32.200
Also,

272
16:32.300 --> 16:34.240
where exactly did you go

273
16:34.560 --> 16:36.220
during the time you were away?

274
16:45.300 --> 16:46.600
I was staying

275
16:52.250 --> 16:54.130
in Fengtai the whole time.

276
17:08.089 --> 17:10.550
You were so foolish.

277
17:12.730 --> 17:15.230
I know you had no choice.

278
17:15.750 --> 17:17.060
You couldn't bear

279
17:17.060 --> 17:18.770
to watch Xueting suffer

280
17:20.030 --> 17:21.680
or risk losing him.

281
17:23.230 --> 17:24.829
But kid, do you realize

282
17:24.859 --> 17:26.010
that what you did

283
17:26.280 --> 17:27.710
will leave

284
17:27.730 --> 17:29.150
a thorn

285
17:29.180 --> 17:31.180
deep in Xueting's heart?

286
17:31.560 --> 17:32.690
But Mom,

287
17:33.710 --> 17:34.900
nothing happened

288
17:34.920 --> 17:36.980
between Yu Changxuan and me.

289
17:38.610 --> 17:40.220
I believe you.

290
17:40.600 --> 17:42.640
Of course I believe you.

291
17:47.490 --> 17:49.960
It's just Xueting's resentment

292
17:50.180 --> 17:52.370
won't disappear

293
17:52.840 --> 17:54.550
overnight.

294
18:00.640 --> 18:04.600
You two need to give each other some time.

295
18:05.470 --> 18:08.510
Xueting knows what kind of person you are.

296
18:09.050 --> 18:11.720
This will gradually

297
18:12.340 --> 18:13.770
blow over.

298
18:16.100 --> 18:17.760
How am I supposed to find a job?

299
18:18.140 --> 18:19.970
Just like last time—

300
18:20.360 --> 18:22.290
let you sacrifice yourself for me?

301
18:22.660 --> 18:23.460
Is that it?

302
18:28.650 --> 18:30.860
You silly girl.

303
18:38.970 --> 18:40.390
Here, here. I want some too.

304
18:40.390 --> 18:41.120
Give me some.

305
18:41.680 --> 18:44.060
-It smells so good. -More. Give me more.

306
18:44.380 --> 18:45.570
Line up! Line up!

307
18:45.790 --> 18:47.810
Don't rush. One by one.

308
18:47.920 --> 18:49.580
There's enough for everyone.

309
18:54.620 --> 18:56.020
You've got another bowl?

310
18:59.560 --> 19:01.400
This mutton soup is so delicious.

311
19:01.400 --> 19:02.410
In all my life,

312
19:02.430 --> 19:04.490
I've never had such rich mutton soup.

313
19:04.630 --> 19:05.550
Have more, Guan Bao.

314
19:05.550 --> 19:06.300
Have more.

315
19:06.300 --> 19:06.860
Okay.

316
19:08.180 --> 19:09.220
At this rate,

317
19:10.050 --> 19:10.800
our Yu Army

318
19:10.800 --> 19:12.400
is unstoppable.

319
19:12.800 --> 19:13.470
Guan Bao.

320
19:13.600 --> 19:14.600
We've already won

321
19:14.600 --> 19:15.860
3 battles in a row.

322
19:15.900 --> 19:16.890
If we keep this up,

323
19:16.890 --> 19:17.900
it won't be long

324
19:17.900 --> 19:19.710
before you can go home and visit your mother.

325
19:19.710 --> 19:20.710
Really, Mr. Sun?

326
19:20.970 --> 19:21.780
Just look—

327
19:22.050 --> 19:24.790
our troops' morale is sky-high!

328
19:26.120 --> 19:26.780
Commander!

329
19:26.790 --> 19:27.450
Commander!

330
19:27.460 --> 19:28.030
Commander.

331
19:28.030 --> 19:28.760
-Greetings, Commander. -Greetings, Commander.

332
19:28.760 --> 19:29.500
-Greetings, Commander. -Greetings, Commander.

333
19:29.500 --> 19:30.830
-Commander. -Commander.

334
19:30.830 --> 19:32.200
-Commander. -Greetings, Commander.

335
19:32.200 --> 19:33.440
-Commander. -Greetings, Commander.

336
19:33.440 --> 19:34.350
-Commander. -Greetings, Commander.

337
19:34.350 --> 19:35.140
Come on, sit.

338
19:35.160 --> 19:36.360
No commander today.

339
19:36.360 --> 19:37.950
Just buddies sharing a meal.

340
19:37.950 --> 19:38.530
Sit.

341
19:39.080 --> 19:40.360
Thank you, Commander!

342
19:41.270 --> 19:42.010
Sit.

343
19:44.510 --> 19:46.110
What were you talking about?

344
19:46.340 --> 19:47.140
Commander.

345
19:47.610 --> 19:48.800
Just look at

346
19:49.100 --> 19:50.920
the spirit and drive everyone's showing.

347
19:50.920 --> 19:53.010
We'll surely win this war in no time!

348
19:53.380 --> 19:53.770
That's right.

349
19:53.770 --> 19:54.900
Scholar just said

350
19:54.970 --> 19:56.240
he'd cast a divination for us.

351
19:56.240 --> 19:58.170
His dice rolls are always spot-on!

352
19:58.640 --> 19:59.340
Everyone!

353
19:59.770 --> 20:00.580
Scholar wants to cast a divination for us

354
20:00.580 --> 20:01.300
using the dice.

355
20:01.300 --> 20:01.970
How about it?

356
20:01.970 --> 20:02.900
Sure!

357
20:02.900 --> 20:03.510
Sure!

358
20:03.530 --> 20:04.360
Come on.

359
20:05.160 --> 20:05.770
Alright then.

360
20:05.770 --> 20:07.700
Let me make a prediction for us all.

361
20:12.860 --> 20:13.640
A 6!

362
20:14.300 --> 20:15.600
A glorious victory!

363
20:15.630 --> 20:18.170
-Great! -Great!

364
20:19.230 --> 20:20.230
Xuewu.

365
20:20.580 --> 20:22.230
Your maps are excellent.

366
20:22.770 --> 20:23.900
Keep up the good work.

367
20:23.900 --> 20:24.790
If you distinguish yourself

368
20:24.790 --> 20:26.390
in the battle for Luanjiang,

369
20:26.600 --> 20:29.560
I'll make an exception and promote you to the staff department.

370
20:29.560 --> 20:30.470
Good for you!

371
20:30.770 --> 20:31.270
Then...

372
20:31.890 --> 20:33.630
Then thank you, Commander!

373
20:33.790 --> 20:34.920
I won't let you down!

374
20:36.550 --> 20:37.340
Dapeng.

375
20:38.090 --> 20:39.550
You've got excellent aim.

376
20:39.900 --> 20:41.100
You're a real talent.

377
20:41.560 --> 20:42.890
I heard you like horses.

378
20:44.300 --> 20:46.470
I'll pick out a fine one for you tomorrow.

379
20:46.470 --> 20:47.540
Really, Commander?

380
20:47.540 --> 20:49.960
That... That's wonderful.

381
20:49.990 --> 20:51.450
I'd like to use this soup instead of wine

382
20:51.450 --> 20:52.260
to toast you!

383
20:53.010 --> 20:54.210
I'll join you in that.

384
20:55.060 --> 20:55.860
Together.

385
20:59.390 --> 21:00.250
Don't eat that.

386
21:03.990 --> 21:05.990
What's wrong with this steamed bun?

387
21:06.050 --> 21:06.860
I'll go ask.

388
21:07.060 --> 21:07.860
No, no, no.

389
21:08.100 --> 21:08.860
Commander.

390
21:10.050 --> 21:12.010
Please don't blame the cookhouse squad.

391
21:12.010 --> 21:13.450
We couldn't bear to throw these steamed buns away,

392
21:13.450 --> 21:15.060
so we specifically asked for them.

393
21:15.060 --> 21:15.640
Look,

394
21:15.660 --> 21:17.050
t-they're still fine, aren't they?

395
21:17.050 --> 21:17.800
And they still taste great.

396
21:17.800 --> 21:18.470
Really.

397
21:19.390 --> 21:20.720
If they're moldy, you shouldn't eat them.

398
21:20.720 --> 21:22.300
I'll have the cookhouse squad bring you fresh ones.

399
21:22.300 --> 21:23.100
Commander,

400
21:23.270 --> 21:24.910
these are already great, really.

401
21:24.910 --> 21:25.660
Before you came,

402
21:25.660 --> 21:27.030
we couldn't even imagine

403
21:27.030 --> 21:28.690
we'd get to eat buns this big.

404
21:29.380 --> 21:30.580
And this mutton soup.

405
21:30.950 --> 21:31.660
Back when we were under

406
21:31.660 --> 21:33.120
Zhao Chenghai's command,

407
21:33.360 --> 21:35.140
all we got was moldy rice bran,

408
21:35.160 --> 21:37.490
and sometimes we wouldn't even get a meal.

409
21:37.600 --> 21:38.980
Look how well we're eating now,

410
21:38.980 --> 21:39.550
right?

411
21:43.050 --> 21:43.840
Commander.

412
21:44.270 --> 21:45.640
If anyone had told me

413
21:45.820 --> 21:47.760
that Zhao Chenghai would be punished

414
21:47.760 --> 21:49.210
and we'd finally get a full meal,

415
21:49.210 --> 21:50.740
I'd never have believed it.

416
21:51.250 --> 21:51.730
But ever since

417
21:51.730 --> 21:53.530
you had Zhao Chenghai executed,

418
21:54.210 --> 21:55.320
you've gained

419
21:55.560 --> 21:56.560
our full support.

420
22:02.340 --> 22:03.520
Dapeng's right.

421
22:04.110 --> 22:05.760
When we served under Zhao,

422
22:05.780 --> 22:07.890
it felt like every day was dark.

423
22:08.560 --> 22:09.660
But after you came along,

424
22:09.660 --> 22:11.030
not only did the sun finally come out,

425
22:11.030 --> 22:12.710
but things have only been

426
22:12.730 --> 22:14.400
getting better and better for us.

427
22:14.400 --> 22:15.470
Isn't that right, guys?

428
22:15.470 --> 22:18.130
Yes, that's right!

429
22:18.190 --> 22:19.190
There's hope now.

430
22:19.410 --> 22:19.980
Exactly!

431
22:20.270 --> 22:20.770
Commander!

432
22:20.770 --> 22:21.430
Commander,

433
22:21.550 --> 22:21.960
here.

434
22:21.980 --> 22:23.110
This piece is clean.

435
22:23.800 --> 22:25.360
I removed the moldy bits.

436
22:25.450 --> 22:26.160
The inside is still good,

437
22:26.160 --> 22:26.970
and it doesn't smell funny.

438
22:26.970 --> 22:27.500
Try some.

439
22:34.600 --> 22:35.250
Okay.

440
22:37.570 --> 22:38.970
I won't forget this meal.

441
22:54.750 --> 22:55.860
I promise you,

442
22:57.300 --> 22:58.700
once this battle is over,

443
22:59.600 --> 23:01.090
we'll return to Nanhuai together

444
23:01.090 --> 23:02.350
and live better lives!

445
23:02.800 --> 23:06.750
-Great! -Great!

446
23:06.790 --> 23:08.220
-Thank you, Commander! -Thank you, Commander!

447
23:08.220 --> 23:10.880
-Thank you, Commander! -Thank you, Commander!

448
23:24.090 --> 23:24.250
[Dragon-Tiger Pills]

449
23:24.250 --> 23:26.850
"Rally your strength and welcome the spring?"

450
23:28.100 --> 23:29.430
That's way too flowery.

451
23:29.600 --> 23:30.450
What do you mean by "snow melts"

452
23:30.450 --> 23:31.560
and "yang rises"?

453
23:31.600 --> 23:33.060
Nobody understands that.

454
23:34.860 --> 23:36.990
We're selling Dragon-Tiger Pills here.

455
23:36.990 --> 23:40.500
The copy should say "regain your virility" and "be full of vigor"—

456
23:40.500 --> 23:41.500
things like that.

457
23:41.560 --> 23:42.320
Rewrite it.

458
23:44.470 --> 23:46.730
"Yang rises" refers to the yangqi stone,

459
23:47.210 --> 23:48.120
which highlights

460
23:48.120 --> 23:49.060
the pills' effects.

461
23:49.060 --> 23:49.610
Besides...

462
23:49.610 --> 23:50.310
No good.

463
23:50.640 --> 23:51.400
Rewrite it.

464
23:57.660 --> 23:58.360
Rewrite it.

465
23:58.450 --> 23:59.230
Rewrite it.

466
23:59.560 --> 24:00.270
I told you

467
24:00.470 --> 24:02.160
to stop writing this incomprehensible nonsense.

468
24:02.160 --> 24:02.860
Rewrite it!

469
24:10.570 --> 24:13.000
[Dragon-Tiger Pills]

470
24:50.140 --> 24:52.470
Are you Mr. Jiang Xueting?

471
24:53.550 --> 24:55.060
May I ask who you are?

472
24:55.160 --> 24:56.270
Hello, Mr. Jiang.

473
24:56.360 --> 24:57.620
My name is He Chenglin.

474
24:57.660 --> 24:58.600
I've come all the way from Guangzhou

475
24:58.600 --> 25:00.660
to Nanhuai specifically to find you.

476
25:04.880 --> 25:06.210
Every newspaper in town

477
25:06.290 --> 25:07.690
has turned me away.

478
25:08.300 --> 25:11.250
Why would anyone want to publish my articles?

479
25:12.950 --> 25:14.810
The local papers are too cowardly

480
25:14.970 --> 25:16.230
and ignorant to publish

481
25:16.230 --> 25:16.970
your work.

482
25:17.340 --> 25:18.380
What we value

483
25:18.580 --> 25:20.710
is exactly your patriotism, Jun Guan,

484
25:20.900 --> 25:22.100
and your courage and conviction

485
25:22.100 --> 25:23.560
in exposing the darkness.

486
25:23.600 --> 25:25.230
You must keep writing

487
25:25.300 --> 25:27.050
powerful articles that shake people awake

488
25:27.050 --> 25:28.180
and open their eyes.

489
25:28.300 --> 25:29.100
Our newspaper

490
25:29.100 --> 25:30.710
aims to spread new ideas

491
25:30.800 --> 25:32.460
and inspire a new generation,

492
25:32.880 --> 25:33.640
so that Chinese people

493
25:33.640 --> 25:35.190
suffering across this land

494
25:35.450 --> 25:37.320
will know that

495
25:37.350 --> 25:39.610
the road ahead belongs to everyone.

496
25:48.160 --> 25:51.560
What's the name of this newspaper?

497
25:52.550 --> 25:54.250
We've all been waiting for you, Jun Guan,

498
25:54.250 --> 25:56.060
to name it.

499
25:59.010 --> 26:00.060
Then how about

500
26:01.730 --> 26:03.930
Xing Newspaper—the Rising Newspaper?

501
26:05.130 --> 26:07.330
[Herbal Pills, Powder, Ointment, and Pills Made According to Traditional Methods]

502
26:08.880 --> 26:09.790
Xueting.

503
26:26.580 --> 26:27.320
Pingjun.

504
26:31.600 --> 26:32.360
Coming.

505
26:33.320 --> 26:33.930
Mom.

506
26:34.700 --> 26:36.510
Xueting's been having a rough time lately.

507
26:36.510 --> 26:38.250
He's lost quite a bit of weight.

508
26:38.570 --> 26:40.170
I made him some chicken soup.

509
26:40.340 --> 26:41.510
Take it over to him.

510
26:44.060 --> 26:44.900
I'll go then.

511
26:47.050 --> 26:48.510
Be careful not to spill it.

512
27:04.510 --> 27:05.230
Xueting.

513
27:05.950 --> 27:07.990
Do you have any idea how long it took me

514
27:07.990 --> 27:09.270
to find you?

515
27:09.450 --> 27:10.190
Yuko.

516
27:10.450 --> 27:11.510
I already made it

517
27:11.860 --> 27:12.790
very clear to you

518
27:12.790 --> 27:13.990
when we were in Japan—

519
27:14.210 --> 27:15.410
it's over between us.

520
27:16.870 --> 27:18.000
I don't believe you.

521
27:18.900 --> 27:20.550
Just because you said we weren't compatible

522
27:20.550 --> 27:22.080
and our feelings had faded?

523
27:22.140 --> 27:23.900
That's ridiculous.

524
27:24.360 --> 27:24.930
Yuko.

525
27:25.250 --> 27:27.200
You can't force feelings.

526
27:27.470 --> 27:29.980
There's absolutely no future for us.

527
27:30.050 --> 27:31.470
But you promised my father

528
27:31.470 --> 27:32.930
you'd take good care of me.

529
27:33.510 --> 27:35.550
And now you just dump me

530
27:35.800 --> 27:38.200
and come back to China whenever you please.

531
27:38.900 --> 27:40.470
How heartless can you be?

532
27:41.980 --> 27:43.040
Oh right, Xueting.

533
27:43.070 --> 27:45.030
Why didn't you mention in your letter

534
27:45.030 --> 27:47.490
that you'd be coming back early this time?

535
27:51.860 --> 27:54.640
I wanted to give you and Pingjun a surprise.

536
27:56.730 --> 27:57.360
Pingjun.

537
27:58.480 --> 28:00.280
Actually, when I was in Japan...

538
28:02.250 --> 28:03.640
What happened in Japan?

539
28:06.800 --> 28:07.640
Nothing.

540
28:15.140 --> 28:15.860
Pingjun...

541
28:18.900 --> 28:19.530
Pingjun!

542
28:21.140 --> 28:21.800
Pingjun!

543
28:21.950 --> 28:23.400
I can explain.

544
28:24.970 --> 28:26.370
What's there to explain?

545
28:26.710 --> 28:27.550
My relationship with her

546
28:27.550 --> 28:28.900
isn't what you think it is.

547
28:28.900 --> 28:29.920
Her father

548
28:29.970 --> 28:31.750
is the chief of the Special Higher Police.

549
28:31.750 --> 28:32.510
Back then, their people

550
28:32.510 --> 28:34.250
beat us international students in public.

551
28:34.250 --> 28:35.430
I only approached her

552
28:35.430 --> 28:36.050
to get

553
28:36.050 --> 28:37.050
their internal documents

554
28:37.050 --> 28:37.620
and seek justice

555
28:37.620 --> 28:38.550
for our people.

556
28:38.970 --> 28:40.010
Seek justice?

557
28:42.300 --> 28:43.100
In the name of seeking

558
28:43.100 --> 28:44.470
your so-called justice,

559
28:44.470 --> 28:45.340
you used an innocent young woman's

560
28:45.340 --> 28:47.070
sincere feelings and hurt her?

561
28:48.450 --> 28:49.310
Jiang Xueting.

562
28:49.770 --> 28:51.010
How can you make something

563
28:51.010 --> 28:52.940
so despicable sound so righteous?

564
28:53.690 --> 28:54.840
P... Pingjun.

565
28:54.970 --> 28:55.770
I'm sorry.

566
28:57.300 --> 28:58.100
Pingjun.

567
28:58.450 --> 28:59.430
A-Actually, as soon as I came back,

568
28:59.430 --> 28:59.960
I wanted to tell you,

569
28:59.960 --> 29:00.660
but...

570
29:00.660 --> 29:01.710
But I was worried that you'd be mad.

571
29:01.710 --> 29:02.550
I honestly didn't know how to

572
29:02.550 --> 29:03.400
bring it up.

573
29:03.450 --> 29:04.100
So you just chose

574
29:04.100 --> 29:05.230
not to tell me at all.

575
29:10.560 --> 29:12.290
You have your own convictions,

576
29:13.140 --> 29:14.470
and I can't judge

577
29:15.060 --> 29:16.550
whether what you did was right or wrong

578
29:16.550 --> 29:19.010
in the name of your so-called greater cause.

579
29:19.140 --> 29:20.420
But Jiang Xueting,

580
29:20.950 --> 29:22.050
you've changed.

581
29:23.060 --> 29:24.400
You're nothing like the person

582
29:24.400 --> 29:25.900
I used to know.

583
29:27.300 --> 29:30.160
You're becoming more and more like a stranger to me.

584
29:31.950 --> 29:33.730
Pingjun, if...

585
29:39.340 --> 29:40.470
I'm sorry.

586
29:44.900 --> 29:47.160
I think we both need some time to cool off.

587
30:07.070 --> 30:10.800
[A Tale of the Opera World]

588
30:10.840 --> 30:13.630
[Resounding Arias]

589
30:17.990 --> 30:20.460
[A Tale of the Opera World]

590
30:25.610 --> 30:28.150
[A Tale of the Opera World]

591
30:38.640 --> 30:40.160
Thank goodness she made it through.

592
30:40.160 --> 30:41.140
I was on pins and needles

593
30:41.140 --> 30:43.090
the whole time.

594
30:43.190 --> 30:44.600
What's that Lan girl's name again?

595
30:44.600 --> 30:45.560
Wasn't she one of the top performers

596
30:45.560 --> 30:46.760
just a few months ago?

597
30:47.050 --> 30:49.300
I told you, go 3 days without practicing and your skills get rusty.

598
30:49.300 --> 30:50.250
From now on,

599
30:50.600 --> 30:52.130
she's pretty much done for.

600
30:57.010 --> 30:58.270
Oh, that face of yours—

601
30:58.340 --> 30:59.840
even the bitterest herb couldn't compare.

602
30:59.840 --> 31:00.770
Taochun.

603
31:00.800 --> 31:02.360
I've put up with you long enough.

604
31:02.360 --> 31:03.850
If you say another rude word,

605
31:03.850 --> 31:04.720
no matter who you are,

606
31:04.720 --> 31:06.220
I'll slap you silly!

607
31:08.100 --> 31:08.900
As if

608
31:08.900 --> 31:09.800
I have time

609
31:09.800 --> 31:11.060
to waste on you people.

610
31:11.470 --> 31:13.120
Just look at her now.

611
31:13.140 --> 31:14.670
Is she even worth my breath?

612
31:14.840 --> 31:16.430
My shows

613
31:16.460 --> 31:17.730
are always sold out,

614
31:17.860 --> 31:18.810
but with her,

615
31:19.460 --> 31:21.340
if the audience could sit through even one act

616
31:21.340 --> 31:24.140
without booing, that would be for old times' sake.

617
31:28.370 --> 31:29.730
Pathetic.

618
31:48.270 --> 31:49.060
Kill!

619
31:50.880 --> 31:51.580
Kill!

620
32:28.340 --> 32:31.270
Commander, there have been no unexpected developments.

621
32:31.270 --> 32:32.010
Everything's proceeding

622
32:32.010 --> 32:33.580
according to your plan.

623
32:34.230 --> 32:36.450
Then we'll await good news.

624
33:06.900 --> 33:07.640
Ambush!

625
33:07.660 --> 33:08.720
There's an ambush!

626
33:15.500 --> 33:16.280
Cover each other

627
33:16.280 --> 33:18.280
and fall back while returning fire!

628
33:18.620 --> 33:19.220
Fall back!

629
33:19.430 --> 33:20.530
Squad One, hold them off!

630
33:20.530 --> 33:23.260
-Retreat! -Squad Two and Three, pull back first!

631
33:23.450 --> 33:24.250
Hold them off!

632
33:24.250 --> 33:24.710
Keep up!

633
33:24.730 --> 33:25.600
Keep up!

634
33:25.600 --> 33:26.440
Hurry!

635
33:26.470 --> 33:27.390
Keep up!

636
33:27.410 --> 33:29.300
Retreat! Hurry!

637
33:50.900 --> 33:51.970
The Qi Army hasn't caught up.

638
33:51.970 --> 33:52.770
And it's getting dark.

639
33:52.770 --> 33:53.700
Let's stop here.

640
33:53.900 --> 33:54.710
Rest on the spot.

641
33:54.710 --> 33:55.570
Stay alert and keep watch.

642
33:55.570 --> 33:56.550
Rest on the spot!

643
33:56.620 --> 33:57.750
Stay alert and keep watch!

644
33:57.750 --> 33:58.470
Stay alert!

645
34:07.300 --> 34:07.760
Come on.

646
34:08.260 --> 34:08.870
Go over there.

647
34:08.870 --> 34:09.280
Stay alert.

648
34:09.280 --> 34:10.100
Commander.

649
34:10.270 --> 34:10.600
Go on.

650
34:11.969 --> 34:13.060
We're currently

651
34:13.060 --> 34:14.060
at this location,

652
34:14.409 --> 34:15.679
about 30 li

653
34:15.679 --> 34:17.199
from where we were ambushed.

654
34:17.199 --> 34:18.050
Did we bring the gear?

655
34:18.050 --> 34:18.780
We brought it all—

656
34:18.780 --> 34:19.659
ammunition, supplies,

657
34:19.659 --> 34:20.719
and the newly arrived

658
34:20.719 --> 34:21.760
German-style submachine guns.

659
34:21.760 --> 34:22.560
We've got everything.

660
34:22.560 --> 34:23.370
Have everyone switch to the new weapons.

661
34:23.370 --> 34:24.010
Yes, sir.

662
34:25.060 --> 34:25.870
Everyone!

663
34:26.239 --> 34:27.500
Switch to the new gear!

664
34:39.050 --> 34:39.850
There's something wrong with my gun.

665
34:39.850 --> 34:40.600
Mine too.

666
34:40.719 --> 34:41.550
Mine too.

667
34:41.550 --> 34:42.570
There's something wrong with mine too.

668
34:42.570 --> 34:43.570
Mine too.

669
34:45.239 --> 34:46.050
Commander.

670
34:46.139 --> 34:47.610
There's something wrong with the guns.

671
34:47.610 --> 34:48.210
Let me see.

672
34:49.449 --> 34:50.179
Give it to me.

673
34:54.260 --> 34:55.659
The firing pin's broken,

674
34:56.010 --> 34:57.480
and the rifling is completely worn down.

675
34:57.480 --> 34:59.680
These are clearly cobbled together from refurbished parts.

676
34:59.680 --> 35:00.340
Commander.

677
35:00.440 --> 35:01.970
Our guns are defective too.

678
35:09.030 --> 35:10.890
They're nothing but scrap metal.

679
35:17.410 --> 35:18.270
How could it be?

680
35:18.640 --> 35:19.760
Mr. Yu's plan was meticulous

681
35:19.760 --> 35:21.350
and carefully thought out.

682
35:21.470 --> 35:22.050
But the route

683
35:22.050 --> 35:23.530
was strictly confidential.

684
35:23.530 --> 35:25.330
And he only took a small force with him.

685
35:25.330 --> 35:26.490
How could the Qi Army have known

686
35:26.490 --> 35:28.060
and set up an ambush in advance?

687
35:28.060 --> 35:28.930
I should have

688
35:28.930 --> 35:29.810
gone with him.

689
35:31.310 --> 35:33.050
Now's not the time to blame yourself.

690
35:33.050 --> 35:34.050
Our top priority

691
35:34.140 --> 35:35.560
is to report this to Commander immediately

692
35:35.560 --> 35:36.950
and discuss countermeasures.

693
35:36.950 --> 35:38.060
If the Qi Army

694
35:38.060 --> 35:39.370
is using a diversionary tactic,

695
35:39.370 --> 35:40.410
we need to

696
35:40.550 --> 35:42.150
be fully prepared on our end.

697
35:43.910 --> 35:45.410
Based on their route,

698
35:45.940 --> 35:47.580
they may retreat toward

699
35:47.950 --> 35:49.120
the area around Qingshi Ridge

700
35:49.120 --> 35:50.580
and the One-Line Pass.

701
35:51.160 --> 35:52.020
It's a long way,

702
35:52.100 --> 35:52.690
so we need to hurry.

703
35:52.690 --> 35:53.970
[East Mountain] [East Slope] [Lower Route]

704
35:53.970 --> 35:56.100
We can't let anything happen to Mr. Yu.

705
35:58.640 --> 35:59.300
Commander.

706
35:59.370 --> 36:00.410
We've checked the surrounding area.

707
36:00.410 --> 36:01.350
No enemy pursuers in sight.

708
36:01.350 --> 36:02.410
We're safe for now.

709
36:13.200 --> 36:13.970
Commander.

710
36:14.410 --> 36:15.670
These past few battles

711
36:15.700 --> 36:17.240
have actually taught me quite a bit.

712
36:17.240 --> 36:17.990
Look.

713
36:18.590 --> 36:20.720
This is Lijian Slope.

714
36:20.810 --> 36:22.950
There's a valley to the south,

715
36:22.970 --> 36:24.510
narrow at the top and wide at the bottom.

716
36:24.510 --> 36:26.530
Strategists call this kind of terrain a "One-Line Pass."

717
36:26.530 --> 36:27.670
It's a short route,

718
36:27.700 --> 36:30.980
and it's easy to defend. One man could hold it against ten thousand.

719
36:30.980 --> 36:32.440
Since we're outnumbered,

720
36:32.470 --> 36:34.600
it's the perfect escape route for us.

721
36:35.440 --> 36:36.450
Scholar Sun.

722
36:37.550 --> 36:38.740
We don't even have

723
36:38.740 --> 36:40.140
modern machine guns now.

724
36:40.810 --> 36:42.210
Don't you have your dice?

725
36:42.540 --> 36:43.890
Take it out and roll it a few times.

726
36:43.890 --> 36:44.800
Let's see if Heaven

727
36:44.800 --> 36:46.060
will leave us a way out.

728
36:46.600 --> 36:47.600
Roll it.

729
36:47.830 --> 36:49.120
Come on, roll it.

730
36:49.160 --> 36:49.640
Fine, fine.

731
36:49.640 --> 36:51.050
I'll roll it.

732
36:54.410 --> 36:55.350
Watch closely.

733
37:19.640 --> 37:21.500
I've fooled others my whole life.

734
37:21.950 --> 37:22.750
Yet in the end,

735
37:23.920 --> 37:25.520
I couldn't even fool myself.

736
37:41.010 --> 37:41.810
Commander.

737
37:48.980 --> 37:50.780
The operation was compromised,

738
37:51.560 --> 37:54.760
and there were also mishaps with the weapon assignments.

739
37:54.970 --> 37:56.570
The responsibility for this

740
37:56.990 --> 37:58.250
lies entirely with me.

741
38:04.410 --> 38:05.140
Commander.

742
38:06.060 --> 38:07.820
As long as we're all together,

743
38:08.060 --> 38:09.560
we'll make it home alive.

744
38:09.970 --> 38:11.060
Scholar here

745
38:11.060 --> 38:12.440
is still waiting for you to promote him

746
38:12.440 --> 38:14.810
and join the staff department when we get back,

747
38:14.810 --> 38:15.560
right?

748
38:16.510 --> 38:17.310
That's right,

749
38:17.510 --> 38:18.440
Commander.

750
38:18.560 --> 38:19.640
I'm still waiting for you

751
38:19.640 --> 38:21.370
to announce to the entire army:

752
38:21.470 --> 38:22.810
"Sergeant Sun Xuewu

753
38:22.810 --> 38:25.550
has proven himself brave in battle and brilliant in strategy.

754
38:25.550 --> 38:28.750
He's hereby promoted to Staff Officer of the Ninth Army!"

755
38:32.550 --> 38:33.350
Commander.

756
38:33.910 --> 38:34.560
You know, back when

757
38:34.560 --> 38:36.140
my father worked as an escort,

758
38:36.140 --> 38:36.970
he once escorted

759
38:36.970 --> 38:39.410
the youngest son of County Magistrate Feng of Huaiyang.

760
38:39.410 --> 38:40.950
His escort team had over 200 men.

761
38:40.950 --> 38:42.890
They traveled from south to north for more than 300 days

762
38:42.890 --> 38:44.700
and encountered bandits 5 times.

763
38:44.700 --> 38:46.510
By the time they reached the Feng family,

764
38:46.510 --> 38:47.400
only 4 men

765
38:47.600 --> 38:48.800
on the team survived.

766
38:48.950 --> 38:50.050
But that young master was still

767
38:50.050 --> 38:51.140
plump and healthy,

768
38:51.140 --> 38:52.390
without a scratch on him.

769
38:52.390 --> 38:54.100
For those of us in the escort trade,

770
38:54.100 --> 38:56.030
loyalty and honor are in our blood.

771
38:56.410 --> 38:57.200
Commander.

772
38:57.810 --> 38:58.810
Actually, I'd already made up my mind

773
38:58.810 --> 39:00.160
when you handed me

774
39:00.410 --> 39:01.910
this horse.

775
39:02.560 --> 39:04.910
Our Yu Army is still missing a cavalry unit.

776
39:04.910 --> 39:05.780
How about I train

777
39:05.780 --> 39:07.240
a cavalry company for you?

778
39:10.050 --> 39:10.850
Sounds great.

779
39:19.850 --> 39:20.640
Yuan Huai.

780
39:21.700 --> 39:22.560
What about you?

781
39:23.010 --> 39:24.270
What's your ambition?

782
39:26.310 --> 39:27.970
I just want to go home and farm.

783
39:30.810 --> 39:32.470
Then why did you join the army?

784
39:36.740 --> 39:37.970
The war broke out,

785
39:40.950 --> 39:42.610
and all the crops were burned.

786
39:43.140 --> 39:44.550
Not a single plot of land

787
39:44.740 --> 39:46.600
can last three seasons.

788
39:51.910 --> 39:53.710
Wheat won't grow there anymore.

789
39:56.370 --> 39:58.170
Once we get through this safely,

790
39:58.700 --> 39:59.620
I'll find you a plot of land

791
39:59.620 --> 40:01.150
on the outskirts of Nanhuai

792
40:01.470 --> 40:02.930
so you can grow your crops.

793
40:19.100 --> 40:19.910
Guan Bao.

794
40:21.470 --> 40:22.560
Everyone else has shared their dreams.

795
40:22.560 --> 40:23.520
What about you?

796
40:23.570 --> 40:24.770
What do you want to do?

797
40:27.010 --> 40:30.690
I... I just miss my mother.

798
40:31.390 --> 40:33.990
I want to go back and see her as soon as possible.

799
40:35.950 --> 40:37.280
Commander, Commander.

800
40:37.310 --> 40:39.310
You know, this kid has a great voice.

801
40:39.310 --> 40:40.060
Bao,

802
40:40.060 --> 40:41.520
sing a song for Commander.

803
40:43.240 --> 40:44.530
Bao can sing?

804
40:45.430 --> 40:46.590
Forget it.

805
40:47.550 --> 40:48.560
Sing us a song.

806
40:48.970 --> 40:49.760
Come on.

807
40:49.810 --> 40:50.510
Yeah.

808
40:50.600 --> 40:51.350
Come on.

809
40:51.370 --> 40:52.830
You really want me to sing?

810
40:53.060 --> 40:53.920
How about this?

811
40:54.700 --> 40:55.970
I have a grenade here.

812
40:57.060 --> 40:58.140
If you sing us a song,

813
40:58.140 --> 40:59.470
I'll give it to you. It could save your life.

814
40:59.470 --> 41:00.130
Commander.

815
41:00.600 --> 41:02.910
I... I don't dare to use this.

816
41:03.890 --> 41:06.550
What if I throw it wrong and hit one of our own men?

817
41:08.200 --> 41:09.460
Then give it back to me.

818
41:12.950 --> 41:14.860
I only know one song.

819
41:20.010 --> 41:21.010
I'll sing it then.

820
41:27.100 --> 41:33.720
♪ Mother, who knows how much you miss me? ♪

821
41:35.200 --> 41:41.910
♪ I dream of you, Mother, in my sleep ♪

822
41:43.050 --> 41:45.310
♪ Oh, Mother ♪

823
41:45.850 --> 41:47.990
♪ Oh, Mother ♪

824
41:49.140 --> 41:56.110
♪ When peach blossoms fall, apricot blossoms bloom ♪

825
42:46.170 --> 42:48.080
The world can be callous,

826
42:49.340 --> 42:50.810
but you're different.

827
42:52.910 --> 42:54.380
You wield great power,

828
42:55.870 --> 42:58.270
yet you've never let it corrupt your heart.

829
42:59.600 --> 43:00.410
So,

830
43:01.140 --> 43:02.240
in your eyes,

831
43:03.280 --> 43:04.280
I'm a good person?

832
43:06.100 --> 43:07.810
Since you guard this land,

833
43:08.920 --> 43:10.280
I pray

834
43:10.850 --> 43:11.780
that your Yu Army

835
43:12.600 --> 43:13.760
can bring the people

836
43:13.760 --> 43:14.950
true peace.

837
43:15.410 --> 43:17.450
That matters far more than

838
43:17.950 --> 43:20.350
whether I consider you a good person or not.

839
43:22.050 --> 43:23.710
I'll keep your encouragement

840
43:24.130 --> 43:25.250
in mind.

841
44:11.740 --> 44:13.410
Enemy! Enemy!

842
44:13.470 --> 44:14.100
Enemy!

843
44:14.100 --> 44:15.200
Take cover!

844
44:15.720 --> 44:17.100
Hurry! Hurry!

845
44:17.540 --> 44:18.640
Take cover!

846
44:19.620 --> 44:20.480
Enemy!

847
44:27.470 --> 44:28.390
Danger!

848
44:32.050 --> 44:32.710
Commander!

849
44:33.670 --> 44:34.510
Commander!

850
44:34.780 --> 44:35.660
My life's worthless.

851
44:35.660 --> 44:37.390
Why would you risk yours for me?

852
44:40.700 --> 44:41.510
Hold them off!

853
44:42.700 --> 44:43.310
Retreat!

854
44:43.430 --> 44:44.850
Retreat to the One-Line Pass!

855
44:44.850 --> 44:45.620
Got it!

856
44:51.360 --> 44:52.210
Hold them off!

857
44:53.130 --> 44:54.600
Hold on!

858
45:06.060 --> 45:07.660
Any cavalryman still breathing, follow me!

859
45:07.660 --> 45:08.810
Bring every grenade we've got!

860
45:08.810 --> 45:09.780
Let's fight our way out

861
45:09.780 --> 45:10.780
for Commander and our buddies!

862
45:10.780 --> 45:11.870
What's He Dapeng trying to do?

863
45:11.870 --> 45:12.410
Come back!

864
45:12.410 --> 45:13.100
He Dapeng!

865
45:13.120 --> 45:13.650
Buddy...

866
45:13.720 --> 45:15.850
-Commander! Commander! -Commander!

867
45:16.660 --> 45:18.760
I'll train the cavalry battalion for you in the next life!

868
45:18.760 --> 45:19.750
Get back here!

869
45:24.240 --> 45:25.050
Buddy!

870
45:27.970 --> 45:29.170
He Dapeng!

871
45:31.990 --> 45:33.920
He Dapeng!

872
45:33.960 --> 45:35.070
Get back here!

873
45:35.090 --> 45:36.300
That's an order!

874
45:36.390 --> 45:38.820
-Come back, buddy! -He Dapeng!

875
45:39.390 --> 45:45.310
-Kill! -Kill!
